Z||000000||Cozmo||05-17-2001||08:11 AM||||The last few weeks I've noticed a LOT of these types of cars tooling around the St. Pete area...<BR>It's like they have been reading this forum, taking all the things we make fun of and putting them on their car.<BR>I've tried to "play" with them, but they seem to be all show no go.<BR>I'm not prejudiced, any car can be made to go faster and handle better and I can appreciate good work no matter what it's done on...<BR><B>But these things are ridiculous!</B><P>I'm scared to use carbon fiber now <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><B>C02M0</B>||||reg||5
