Z||000002||Taijiguy||05-17-2001||08:39 AM||||I think there's a mentality/attitude/intelligence level (or lack thereof) that accompanies those guys. Every one I've ever "engaged" on the streets was arrogant, and seemingly just plain stupid. The last guy I played with got humiliated in front of his girlfriend. We were doing quick acceleration jaunts, and he was getting crushed. The last time, I slowed down as I came up on the guy in front of me, and this backwards hat boy hits it again, but I was about to turn left and had proven my point, so I just held. He kicks it, and just <I>barely</I> cleared my front end, and yanked it over, cutting me off, scaring the hell out of me, and jumps over two lanes. I pulled over behind him, and we both made a left. He went straight, and I turned onto a service road. But it was all I could do to keep from following him home, and ripping the wing off his car and beating him with it.||||reg||1
