Z||000004||Oreif||05-17-2001||10:36 AM||||I have also noticed the attitude of them being crappy too. They'll try to race anything. To me it seems it's the ones who try to make the car "look" fast with all the items from aisle #2 at Trak Auto. I've even noticed that the folks who actually do make their cars faster (or already have the faster cars) are being snubbed by the punks in the fakes. The most fun I have is when I come home from work at night, many want to race me (I use a 98 Durango for work) So at the light I rev up the V-8, Light turns green, they push all 68HP to the tires, maybe get a screech, and go flying down the road. I just take off normally, A V-8 durango can drink a lot of gas if you try to hot rod it. At over $2.00 a gallon I'll go for the gas mileage. The best part is the police officer with his radar gun catching the moron speeding down the road.<BR>I just wish they would teach these boys that a 3.5L DOHC sticker from a dodge intrepid, a coffee can, and a K&N sticker does not make a base hyunai excel go any faster. I saw one try and race a 2001 Eclipse Spyder. I think the guy in the Eclipse didn't even know he was in a race, and he still won!||||reg||1
Z||000005||AusFiero||05-17-2001||11:41 AM||||Oh god no..you have hyundai excels too...aint they the lowest hey (c:<P>I had a stupid saleman in a dealership once try to sell me one when I was looking at performance cars. But you get a wing, and mags was his pitch. He figured it was all I could afford as they was only about $12,000 new. Needless to say I bought my new Subaru WRX turbo elsewhere.<P>How he ever figured I was going to be happy in an excel when I was looking for something faster than the Magna Sports I had I will never know. Musta been lets move hyundais month. Like what idiot switches from a fuel injected 6 with a tiptronic transmission to an underpowered sewing machine with all the appeal of an edsel.<P>Why do they have attitude and think they are fast. I think the owners have some kind of new car syndrome...Mines new...it has to be faster than your old car.<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero.gif"> <BR>When I was young I spent 80% of my money on Women, Gambling and Alcohol. I guess I wasted the rest.||||reg||1
