Z||000010||Slammed Fiero||05-17-2001||08:50 PM||||My old roomate has a neon sport . He took the "Spo" off the side so it says "RT" , he has a cherry bomb muffler (the first sign of performance) and a big grapefruit launcher. He talks his car up. figures since he has a K&N fiter and cherry bomb it's 190hp , He tries to race everything , including street bikes. Last time I talked to him he mentioned a few more mods and he will beat an S2000. He took it to the strip last summer. the car combined with his amazing driving skill burned up the strip to the tune of a 16.7 in the 1/4 ..What a machine.<P>FieroLisa can Vouch for his level of intelligence , it's below that of any ricer i have seen. In defense I do have a few ricer friends who know what there doing and are quite knowledgeable , but those are few and far between in my town.<P><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.||||reg||1
