Z||000012||danny boy||05-17-2001||10:25 PM|||| I had some moron in an OLD Honda prelude with a big H on the hood/fender and another H on the gas cap door pull up beside me in the Stealth not too long ago. He looked over and revved. I looked back and laughed. He got mad, and I laughed some more. Then he nailed it. Engine screaming shooting quick glances over at me,he banged second. I stayed beside him a few seconds,so I could give him that "man,you're an idiot" look, shifted into second myself and gently pulled away. Turbos never even spooled.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PFF_sig_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
